00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:49.790
She's finally here, huh?

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:57.090
Where are you, Asuka?

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:58.990
I came up here like you wanted.

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:00.380
Homura-chan...

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:06.930
Asuka...

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:13.650
Well, whatever.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.650
I've got a ton of questions for—

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.910
Don't participate in the Shinobi Masters.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:22.580
You're telling me the same
thing you told Yumi, huh?

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:25.410
Well, I'm willing to pass on joining.

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:29.420
It's your job to save the Hanzo girls.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.470
And I know you've
got your reasons,

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:34.160
and you don't want to share them.

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:37.420
So there's no need
to worry about the details.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:40.230
We can settle things with a fight!

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:42.720
Shinobi transformation!

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:46.220
That's how we've always done it!

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.700
That's who we are, I think!

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:54.340
You and me!

00:18:57.610 --> 00:19:00.860
Am I wrong, Asuka?

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:04.870
Homura-chan...

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:22.210
Asuka, stand up.

00:19:22.210 --> 00:19:23.770
This isn't like you.

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:26.350
Homura-chan...

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:28.770
You're being naïve.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.910
A sneak attack?

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:42.760
That's how evil ninjas fight!

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:47.570
What happened to the heart
of justice you were so proud of?

00:19:47.570 --> 00:19:49.100
In this world...

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:52.080
...there is no justice!

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:55.510
No justice?

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.470
Liar!

00:19:57.980 --> 00:20:00.960
That's not what you think!

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:03.880
I can tell because we've
fought so many times!

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:06.480
You and I are light and shadow!

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:09.470
We're always together!

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.820
You're me...

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:13.230
and I'm you!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.240
As long as I follow my path,

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:20.240
I know you'll always stay true to yours!

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.490
So...

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:27.530
That's why I...

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:33.750
I decided you were my strongest friend!

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:50.390
Asuka!

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:54.020
Accept my full power!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:58.350
And I will accept all your feelings!

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:00.800
I just told you, Homura-chan.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:01.650
You're being naïve.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.620
A-Asuka...

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:48.840
What was that?

00:21:52.940 --> 00:21:54.430
What I just felt...

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:28.510
Wow, this is nuts!

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:30.480
What about this?

00:23:30.480 --> 00:23:33.350
A female teacher, huh? I like it.

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:35.310
What's your name?

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:38.400
Shinobi Masters, the battle
to determine the ultimate shinobi!

00:23:38.400 --> 00:23:41.320
It is time for the battle to begin!
